{"title":"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is inscribed in a circle with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efabb5a2551b88652022f585f3381868d3a207e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC=70^{\\circ}, \\angle ADB=40^{\\circ}, AD=4,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"295\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a4826138756e48059393331c30916b2b06430cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=6$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b45ceb85ba79fbd3f1b2e5f914a035d675cb5e00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\; 3+\\sqrt{5} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\; 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\; \\dfrac{9}{2}\\sqrt{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\; 8-\\sqrt{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\; 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"468\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/8/718105456aa41c974333e9ffe73a31053003c68b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADB$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/0728bebb477a2636300c56851b6a6f9e382c1b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> are both subtended by segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a21326462431b99994bb66d78d03ff3da13904c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACB = \\angle ADB = 40^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"184\" height=\"13\" />. By considering <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155625d4f421845a0e52c0df03a1e54ea86c3555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC = 180^\\circ - (70^\\circ + 40^\\circ) = 70^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"273\" height=\"18\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is isosceles, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/7/8d76574aadeaa735b34db03aacadf757162619f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = BC = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\; 6}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"163\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\nNote: The statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820bf77420841403304ea0b1c6eadf5e50bd1b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" /> is not needed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B\">2015 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title